Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 05:53:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] fix(config): unify parser configs in root config/, remove
 stale core/config

- config/import-parser.php was a truncated copy missing content_raw/blocks/marker_aliases -> import silently fell back to legacy parsing; restored full working version (from core/config, which code actually needs)
- config/page-content.php lost views.async + flush tuning keys -> ViewCounter reverted to sync mode by default; restored full version
- removed core/config/ entirely: no PHP code references it anymore (all require paths point to /config/)
- verified: bracket balance + required keys present in all 4 config files
